  "body": "## Breaking Changes \r\n*none*\r\n\r\n## New Features\r\n*none*\r\n\r\n## Fixes\r\n* async replication: retry a panicking hashtree init attempt and gate hashbeat on readiness by @jeroiraz in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13202\r\n* fix(reindex): index writes that land in a semantic migration's swap window by @etiennedi in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13001\r\n* backport: try to safe cast array values  by @DanielJanicek in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13223\r\n* fix(raft): guard the bootstrap candidates map against concurrent notifies by @jeroiraz in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12533\r\n* fix: publish the raft node atomically to close a boot-time data race by @jeroiraz in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/12623\r\n* fix(raft): load the atomic raft node at the FSM barrier call sites by @jeroiraz in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13225\r\n* fix(stream): soft memory backpressure for `BatchStream` by @tsmith023 in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13028\r\n* test(grpc): fix TestBatchObjectsSemaphore deadlock by @byronvoorbach in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13228\r\n* backport: drop the experimental search flag, harden the family for default-on (#13067) by @g-despot in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13233\r\n* Speed up the wait-group linter from ~100s to under a second by @dirkkul in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13236\r\n* Delete dead AddLinksAtLevel by @dirkkul in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13239\r\n* test(replication): split async replication acceptance tests into two CI groups by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13234\r\n* Summarize storage lookup timings in every slow-query log line by @dirkkul in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13124\r\n* perf(roaringsetrange): build compaction nodes into one reused buffer by @aliszka in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13154\r\n* test(replication): reduce replica-slow acceptance test suite time by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13245\r\n* test(acceptance): start the shared server only for suites that use it and reuse it for single-node tests by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13244\r\n* Expose the batch-delete cap in the gRPC BatchDeleteReply by @byronvoorbach in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13103\r\n* Cap the filtered batch delete resolve at QUERY_MAXIMUM_RESULTS by @byronvoorbach in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13104\r\n* Resolve filter and batch-delete doc ids in parallel by @byronvoorbach in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13106\r\n* refactor(test): start the shared acceptance server by default and skip it only for own-cluster suites by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13251\r\n* async replication: drain on a reuse-safe latch instead of a shared WaitGroup by @jeroiraz in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13201\r\n* debug: allow the debug vector rebuild on HFresh by @asdine in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13257\r\n* Answer 422 or 404 for an invalid class name instead of 500 or 403 by @dirkkul in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13260\r\n* test(db): speed up the slowest integration tests by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13263\r\n* test(acceptance): cut fast-group-3 test time by half by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13264\r\n* fix(backup): poll participant status with exponential backoff during commit by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13266\r\n* perf(refcache): index cacher jobs by identifier to avoid quadratic lookup by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13267\r\n* fix(ci): reduce number of articles ingested in `TestGRPC_Batching` by @tsmith023 in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13259\r\n* test(acceptance): cut fast-group-5 test time by over a third by @antas-marcin in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13268\r\n* debug: allow the debug vector rebuild on geo indexes by @asdine in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13261\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/compare/v1.39.6...v1.39.7",
